ph","text":"ヨーロッパの街並みや\n雰囲気を味わいたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、たくさん\n博物館や資料館、美術館に行きたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性は浴衣派？甚平派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→難しい質問だけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人っぽく見えるのは浴衣！\n親しみやすいのは甚平！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも似合ってたら素敵だと思うよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張を紛らわすには何をしてますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→とにかく、冷静な自分を\n心の中に置く。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着け私。落ち着け私。と..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、\nできるやれるできるやれる\n君ならできるよできるやれる\nという呪文を唱える。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い時は、扇風機派？エアコン派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→扇風機派！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだお家のエアコン使ってないんだ〜\n家が風通しが良くて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ前にするルーティーンは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→元祖overtureでは、背中の叩き合い。\n気合いを入れるために。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragra